   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We invested $9 million in direct equity in Light Microfinance in 2022 as part of a fundraise with existing investors Nordic Microfinance Initiative, Triple Jump and Incofin.Our capital will increase access to finance for underserved populations in rural India, primarily women, as well as provide employment opportunities. It will support Light in scaling their microfinance lending in a context where there is limited investor interest in the sector.</narrative>
